# Vector 15 - GENERATE AC command data, built from the CDOL1 (8C) of Vector 3
# Synthetic terminal parameters; no cardholder data. A CDOL never requests the PAN or Track 2.
# CDOL1 = 9F02:6 9F03:6 9F1A:2 95:5 5F2A:2 9A:3 9C:1 9F37:4 9F35:1 9F45:2 9F4C:8 9F34:3 = 43 octets.
# Each entry names the Book 3 v4.4 §5.4 rule it exercises:
#   9F02 Amount, Authorised (n)    123456           -> 000000123456      short: pad LEADING 00
#   9F03 Amount, Other (n)         not given        -> 000000000000      absent: all-zero fill
#   9F1A Terminal Country Code (n) 0840             -> 0840              exact
#   95   Terminal Verif. Results   0000000000       -> 0000000000        exact
#   5F2A Transaction Currency (n)  0840             -> 0840              exact
#   9A   Transaction Date (n)      260724           -> 260724            exact (2026-07-24)
#   9C   Transaction Type (n)      00               -> 00                exact
#   9F37 Unpredictable Number      01A2B3C4         -> 01A2B3C4          exact
#   9F35 Terminal Type (n)         22               -> 22                exact
#   9F45 Data Authentication Code  not given        -> 0000              absent, and not in the dictionary
#   9F4C ICC Dynamic Number        0011223344556677 -> 0011223344556677  not in the dictionary, but given
#   9F34 CVM Results               1E03             -> 1E0300            short: pad TRAILING 00
00 00 00 12 34 56 00 00 00 00 00 00 08 40 00 00 00 00 00 08 40 26 07 24 00
01 A2 B3 C4 22 00 00 00 11 22 33 44 55 66 77 1E 03 00
